f&oh=00_AQTnP_yGsaoEM4NqsbAMOMrAxVv5KXmND-zDGTaPiBsDZg&oe=6AE8AC3F"}, {"file_name": "Adobe Express - file (21).png", "id": "1552344403339981", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499294643_1552344406673314_307472206365219018_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D7gpjTZlw4sQ7kNvwH0UijH&_nc_oc=AdpLm9rL0VJSk7g0EzIM4Cco4a1DocPxBXw8wBN0MGS_jXXh2QIzD-ohkXzY4p0L9_Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS8Vx9qoJmxJdO4j5GDB0DQsRXTVDFaqizosz2ZSsaagw&oe=6AE88CDA"}, {"file_name": "image5.png", "id": "4405966936385187", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305443_4405966939718520_7358778608815373503_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hK9xACqcRzEQ7kNvwET3a83&_nc_oc=AdpGtIRcisHOkvM07cgUxWHllJG6_Yx-zzc3o0iXC53ge_WDnPxNBRjbakTHPq0IwNg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQPEfzYIEbjmbqMEIrr97LvzytzMz_Y-0sqNrFav7ZhmQ&oe=6AE8BE76"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Dont Blink", "keywords": ["horror", "scary", "backrooms", "liminal"], "long_description": "Don't Blink is a multiplayer VR horror game by TripleCGames that drops you and your friends into the Backrooms: endless flickering halls and something that should not be there. Move like a gorilla, climb, and work together across 7 levels, each with its own monster and way out.\n\nLevel 1: Find the missing ladder pieces while the entity hunts you. Watch for pits.\nLevel 2 - The Poolrooms: Turn all 8 valves to open the vault. Whatever you do, don't stare at it.\nLevel 3: Find the hidden buttons. The monster only freezes while someone is looking at it. The moment everyone looks away, it moves.\nLevel 4 - The Forest: Explore by day. When night falls, the forest isn't safe.\nLevel 5: Track down and switch on the TVs.\nLevel 6 - Run For Your Life: It chases you and only gets faster. Make it to the light.\nLevel 7 - Restore the Power: Fix the fuse boxes to open the exit. It hears your voice... and might talk back.\n\nBe The Monster: Hide-and-seek infection mode. Everyone the monster catches joins the hunt. Vote on maps and play Ranked to climb from Bronze to Master.\n\nFeatures:\n- Multiplayer VR horror for up to 10 players\n- Proximity voice chat (monsters can hear you too)\n- 7 levels with unique monsters and objectives\n- Be The Monster with map voting and Ranked seasons\n- Cosmetics, wardrobe, Grappler, Size Changer, Long Arms and more\n- Built for Meta Quest\n\nMore levels, monsters and modes in development.", "short_description": "Don't Blink is a multiplayer VR horror experience set in the infamous Backrooms. Explore endless liminal corridors with friends while being hunted by a terrifying entity. Stay silent, stay still, and whatever you do \u2014 don't blink. Features proximity voice chat, a relentless AI monster, and more levels coming soon. How long can you survive?"}]}, "developer_name": "BmixBOI", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://triplecgames.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TripleCGames", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://triplecgames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1135716692442565"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"